    "detailed_description": "<i>Red Trees Rail Co</i> is a Virtual Reality Horror Train simulator that puts you in the seat of a steam train operator.<br><br>There is a recent need for a night train from town to town in the lovely Redwood Forest. It is cozy, dark, and quiet. <br>To keep costs low, a once decommissioned steam engine will now be brought back to service with a few modern upgrades. <br>However, recent reports have noted creepy sightings and unusual events occurring on this train route. <br><br>Exploring this new opportunity, you play as a character who is trying to pay off some debt.<br><br>Operator Duties include:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Driving the Train using Realistic Locomotive Controls<br></li><li>Picking Up and Dropping Off Passengers at Stations<br></li><li>Checking Passenger Tickets</li></ul><br>You may experience hallucinations during your journey. Some see ghosts, wrecked interior, and more.<br><br>Thankfully, you are provided the past engineer's notebook for info and survival.<br><br><strong>Can You Stay Calm and Survive the Night?</strong>",
